  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Implementering/M&amp;E System/MINIRENA</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Initial implementation M&amp;E System/MINIRENA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Det inledande genomf&#xf6;randet ringp&#xe4;rmsmekanismer/M&amp;E-Systemet &#xe4;r den   f&#xf6;rsta genomf&#xf6;randefasen av det nyutvecklade ringp&#xe4;rmsmekanismer      M&amp;E-Systemet f&#xf6;r ENR sektorn.Denna fas inneb&#xe4;r identifiering av       tillg&#xe4;ngliga kapacitet och utveckling krav i ENR sektor, &#xf6;versyn av   nuvarande M&amp;E system f&#xf6;r kvalitetss&#xe4;kring</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The initial implementation phase of RBM/M&amp;E System for the ENR Sector is the first stage of implementing the newly developed M&amp;E System,    which among others entails; identifying available capacity and        capacity development requirement in the ENR Sector, review of the     current M&amp;E systems for quality assurance in sub sectors of ENR       Sector, relevance and alignment of Key indicators.</narrative>
  </description>
